<title>UK: UK M0 rises s/a 5.9% in year to July.</title>
<headline>UK M0 rises s/a 5.9% in year to July.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England published the following data on UK narrow monetary aggregates for July -</p>
<p>   MONEY SUPPLY			July    June</p>
<p>   M0 in month	 (adjusted)  0.1     1.0</p>
<p>	in year to date(adjusted)  5.9     6.2 (rev)</p>
<p>   M0 in month     (unadjusted)  1.1     0.6</p>
<p>   in year to date (unadjusted)  5.8     6.3</p>
<p>Note - Consensus forecast s/a 0.4 percent MM, 6.3 percent YY.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7715</p>
</text>
